# Leave unset to use same-origin /api:
#   - Local: Vite proxies to http://localhost:4000 (vite.config.js)
#   - Vercel: serverless proxy needs BACKEND_URL set in the Vercel project (repo root api/[...path].js)
#
# Or point straight at a public API (mobile + web):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com/api
